          "text": "{\"regions\":{\"r2\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"107. That which is not to take place, never takes place,\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"nor is a thing fated to take place averted, in this world,\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"owing to the force of destiny, though a man may dive into\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"water, ascend to the top of the mountain Meru, conquer\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"enemies in battle, learn trade, agriculture and all other arts\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"and sciences, ( or ) pass like a bird with great effort through\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"the infinite sky.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r3\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"108. To a man possessing immense merit ( laid by ) in a\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"former life, a dreary forest becomes a capital city, all men\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"act in a friendly way towards him and the whole earth be-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"comes full of precious deposits and gems.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r4\":{\"type\":\"heading\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"MISCELLANEOUS.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r5\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"1 See p. 16.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r6\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"2. What is an advantage gained? The company of the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"virtuous. What is misery? The company of those that are\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"not learned. What is loss? Wasting an opportunity.\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"What is perfection? Being devoted to one\u2019s religious princi-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"ples. Who is a brave man? One that has restrained his\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"senses. What woman is most beloved? One that is devoted.\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":8,\"text\":\"What is wealth? Learning. What is happiness? Not going\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":9,\"text\":\"on a journey. What is kingdom? The power to command.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r7\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"3. High-souled persons have, like the m\u00e2lat\u00ed flower, two\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"fates ( in store for them), either to be at the head of all men,\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"or to fade away in a forest.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r8\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"4. The earth is here and there adorned by persons who\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"are poor in unpalatable speech, rich in pleasing words, con-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"tent with connubial happiness and desisting from calumniat-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"ing others.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r9\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"5. As by the sun of profusely glittering splendour, so by\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"a warrior, though single-handed, the entire surface of the\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r1\":{\"type\":\"page_number\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"[ 20 ]\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null}},\"units\":[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"type\":\"translation\",\"number\":null,\"label\":null,\"open_start\":true,\"open_end\":true,\"children\":[\"u2\",\"u3\",\"u4\",\"u5\",\"u6\",\"u7\",\"u8\",\"u9\"]},{\"id\":\"u2\",\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"number\":\"107\",\"label\":null,\